    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/6aa6eb84b336a296292ab1170cabe979.avif?t=1738759251\" width=500 height=287 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/401ae0c67aa828e349176c2575c87272.avif?t=1738759251\" width=190 height=89 /></span> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world with quacky friends</h2>Adventure through a gushing river or even a danger-filled pirate ship while finding exclusive characters to wear and show off to your friends. Unlock new and bigger worlds to traverse and explore bird-filled lands as a quacking rubber duck.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Help ponks complete tasks to progress.<br></li><li><strong>Collect</strong> bubbles to unlock new locations on the train.<br></li><li>Find <strong>hundreds</strong> of secrets and easter eggs through the interesting worlds.<br></li><li>Complete special <strong>quests</strong> to unlock items and characters.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/1c2d72f899026a494e59db8cc9d01cd0.poster.avif?t=1738759251\" width=414 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/1c2d72f899026a494e59db8cc9d01cd0.webm?t=1738759251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/1c2d72f899026a494e59db8cc9d01cd0.mp4?t=1738759251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/2b69d740aa0907d9a013b6697a710751.avif?t=1738759251\" width=232 height=89 /></span> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip ability items and skins to become your own quacky character.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customise</strong> your duck with a multitude of unique characters.<br></li><li>Use ability items to overcome obstacles and have fun.<br></li><li>Use emotis to <strong>express yourself</strong> within messages</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/47adb48d3b6f19ffc9b94464d4ee3b7a.poster.avif?t=1738759251\" width=488 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/47adb48d3b6f19ffc9b94464d4ee3b7a.webm?t=1738759251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/47adb48d3b6f19ffc9b94464d4ee3b7a.mp4?t=1738759251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/7765b87bdfe995ab31f3b2cb31994676.avif?t=1738759251\" width=232 height=89 /></span> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hangout and voyage with friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discuss with an in-depth chat system.<br></li><li>Work together to complete difficult puzzles and challenges.<br></li><li>Display your fashionable attire to others.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/61ab72795d73c6bf488e7078461ee535.poster.avif?t=1738759251\" width=354 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/61ab72795d73c6bf488e7078461ee535.webm?t=1738759251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/61ab72795d73c6bf488e7078461ee535.mp4?t=1738759251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_-_<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907120/extras/023eb3d657810cadfd689c7d4a2fc7ae.avif?t=1738759251\" width=100 height=76 /></span></h2>",
